From: Tyler South <tsouth2@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 13:39:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 12/13] Ship the tools Omarchy's keybindings and menus call

Screen recording (ALT+PRINT, issue #28) failed because gpu-screen-recorder
was never in the trimmed transaction, and the same trim left the screenshot
editor (tensaku), OCR capture (tesseract), QR capture and sharing (zbar,
qrencode), emoji and clipboard paste (wtype), updatedb after AUR installs
(plocate), man pages, xdg-terminal-exec, the calculator, writer and video
trimmer, Herdr, and the screen-share picker missing behind bound keys and
menu entries. Ship them. The big optional apps (Docker, LibreOffice, OBS,
Kdenlive, Obsidian, Aether, Cliamp) stay out of the image.
---
 guest/packages.txt | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/guest/packages.txt b/guest/packages.txt
index fce0715..741b3b5 100644
--- a/guest/packages.txt
+++ b/guest/packages.txt
@@ -19,11 +19,14 @@ foot
